cff-version: 1.2.0
title: bugarach
type: software
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, and also cite the
  upstream method references listed in the README's Licensing & citations
  section (PySpike/SPIKE-synchronization, CICADA, and the detector method
  papers).
authors:
  - family-names: DeFazio
    given-names: Richard
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/syncytium2/bugarach"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based viewer and Python ports of six neural-coordination
  detectors (rate+context, CoactDetect, LoCo, binned SCE, locust,
  SPIKE-synchronization), each validated to 1e-9 against MATLAB reference
  output.
